pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$paper"
notes: 研究切口页：把三篇文献缝成一个闭环提案。四步循环：DES 仿真产轨迹 → OPTO 生成式优化做 best-response → 均衡探测 → 好调节器检验。右侧强调与 RL 路线的差异和 ShadowFlow 的现成资产。
elements:
  - elementId: label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 40, 400, 18]
    content:
      style: "$label"
      text: 04 · 研究切口
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 64, 880, 38]
    content:
      style: "$pagetitle"
      text: 提案：Trace 驱动的经验博弈均衡分析
  - elementId: c1
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [48, 128, 200, 96]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$soft"}
  - elementId: c1t
    elementType: text
    bounds: [62, 138, 172, 76]
    content:
      fontSize: 12
      color: "$ink"
      lineHeight: 1.45
      text: |
        <p><strong>① DES 仿真</strong></p>
        <p>万级 agent 市场仿真，产出完整执行轨迹</p>
  - elementId: ca1
    elementType: line
    bounds: [248, 168, 40, 16]
    viewBox: [40, 16]
    points: "0,8 40,8"
    curve: sharp
    arrow: [null, "arrow"]
    border: {style: solid, width: 2, color: "$gray"}
  - elementId: c2
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [288, 128, 200, 96]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$soft"}
  - elementId: c2t
    elementType: text
    bounds: [302, 138, 172, 76]
    content:
      fontSize: 12
      color: "$ink"
      lineHeight: 1.45
      text: |
        <p><strong>② 轨迹优化</strong></p>
        <p>OPTO：轨迹+反馈做生成式 best-response</p>
  - elementId: ca2
    elementType: line
    bounds: [488, 168, 40, 16]
    viewBox: [40, 16]
    points: "0,8 40,8"
    curve: sharp
    arrow: [null, "arrow"]
    border: {style: solid, width: 2, color: "$gray"}
  - elementId: c3
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [528, 128, 200, 96]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$soft"}
  - elementId: c3t
    elementType: text
    bounds: [542, 138, 172, 76]
    content:
      fontSize: 12
      color: "$ink"
      lineHeight: 1.45
      text: |
        <p><strong>③ 均衡探测</strong></p>
        <p>检验偏离是否仍有利可图（ε-Nash）</p>
  - elementId: ca3
    elementType: line
    bounds: [728, 168, 40, 16]
    viewBox: [40, 16]
    points: "0,8 40,8"
    curve: sharp
    arrow: [null, "arrow"]
    border: {style: solid, width: 2, color: "$gray"}
  - elementId: c4
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [768, 128, 144, 96]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$primary"}
  - elementId: c4t
    elementType: text
    bounds: [780, 138, 120, 76]
    content:
      fontSize: 12
      color: "#F7F3E8"
      lineHeight: 1.45
      text: |
        <p><strong>④ 调控检验</strong></p>
        <p>好调节器定理检验央行内部模型</p>
  - elementId: loop-back
    elementType: line
    bounds: [148, 224, 620, 40]
    viewBox: [620, 40]
    points: "620,0 310,40 0,0"
    curve: smooth
    arrow: [null, "arrow"]
    border: {style: dash, width: 2, color: "$primary"}
  - elementId: loop-back-t
    elementType: text
    bounds: [148, 266, 620, 18]
    content:
      fontSize: 11
      color: "$primary"
      align: [center, top]
      text: 发现更优策略 → 扩充博弈 → 回到①重新仿真（EGTA 式迭代）
  - elementId: diff-head
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 308, 864, 22]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      bold: true
      color: "$ink"
      text: 与主流 MARL 路线的差异
  - elementId: diff
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 336, 864, 76]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 12.5
      lineHeight: 1.55
      text: |
        <p>· <strong>不依赖奖励函数设计</strong>：反馈可以是市场评论、风控警告、合规驳回等自然语言信号（回应启动会"结果高度依赖奖励函数"的痛点）</p>
        <p>· <strong>可解释</strong>：每次参数更新附带 LLM 的归因推理，而非黑箱梯度步</p>
        <p>· <strong>与规模解耦</strong>：优化只发生在"关键角色"的轨迹上，背景种群保持廉价规则 agent</p>
  - elementId: asset
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 424, 864, 60]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 13
      lineHeight: 1.55
      text: |
        <p><strong>ShadowFlow 的现成资产：</strong>RunTrajectory / TrajectoryBundle 契约已有 Trace 所需的轨迹数据结构；rejection loop 与策略矩阵天然是"丰富反馈源"；循环引擎提供 PDCA 骨架。<span style="color:$primary;">补 DES 内核 + OPTO 优化层即闭环。</span></p>
  - elementId: foot-rule
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [48, 514, 864, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: foot
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 520, 600, 14]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      text: 研究提案 · 详见研究报告 §4.4
  - elementId: page-no
    elementType: text
    bounds: [880, 520, 32, 14]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      align: [right, top]
      text: "13"
